|magazine=w:The Guardian Weekly
|title=Urban canopies let nature bloom
|url=http://www.guardian.co.uk/environment/2013/may/04/paris-green-roofs-building-climate-environment
|passage=As towns continue to grow, replanting vegetation has become a '''form''' of urban utopia and green roofs are spreading fast. Last year 1m square metres of plant-covered roofing was built in France, as much as in the US, and 10 times more than in Germany, the pioneer in this field.}}
